         <t:abstract><t:p>The <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">Sǝbḥata fǝqur</t:foreign> is an office composed of both fixed and optional
            prayers and hymns. It follows the <t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1961Mashaf">Maṣḥafa saʿātāt</t:ref> in manuscripts, with whose office that of the
            <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">Sǝbḥata fǝqur</t:foreign> is considered to form a unity.</t:p></t:abstract>
